WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:02,210
The next customer is Boss Xia

2
00:00:02,370 --> 00:00:04,130
Please give me a room, please

3
00:00:04,130 --> 00:00:05,370
My child is dying

4
00:00:05,370 --> 00:00:06,370
Please, Boss Xia

5
00:00:06,370 --> 00:00:07,290
Boss Xia, give me a room

6
00:00:07,290 --> 00:00:09,050
I also have children at home. Please, Boss Xia.

7
00:00:09,050 --> 00:00:10,210
Me too Me too Me too Me too

8
00:00:10,210 --> 00:00:11,210
Don't make any noise yet

9
00:00:11,210 --> 00:00:13,050
You stand with your family

10
00:00:13,050 --> 00:00:14,770
I allocate rooms based on the number of people

11
00:00:15,760 --> 00:00:18,160
Don't worry, you can live in it now. You can go first.

12
00:00:18,720 --> 00:00:21,120
Just stay in the last double room, room 310.

13
00:00:21,860 --> 00:00:23,780
You guys will stay in single room 206 for the time being.

14
00:00:23,780 --> 00:00:25,060
If the double room is available

15
00:00:25,060 --> 00:00:26,300
Arrange for your priority check-in

16
00:00:26,930 --> 00:00:35,870
The rest of you will live in single rooms.

17
00:00:35,990 --> 00:00:37,030
Wait for the guests to put their things away

18
00:00:37,030 --> 00:00:37,950
You call everyone down

19
00:00:37,950 --> 00:00:39,310
I have something I need to tell you in advance
